{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cost Accountant Assistant","role":"Cost Accountant Assistant","summary":"A Cost Accountant Assistant supports the costing and management-accounting function by collecting cost data, preparing cost sheets, analysing variances, assisting with budgets and supporting management decisions. It is an excellent entry point toward Cost Accountant, Management Accountant, Cost Analyst, FP&A and Finance Manager roles.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Cost & Management Accounting"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Financial accounting, costing and Excel fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Cost accounting, budgeting and industrial internship"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Cost Accountant Assistant / Costing Executive"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Cost Analyst / Senior Cost Accountant"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Management Accountant / Costing Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2043"},{"text":"Finance Manager / Cost Controller"}],[{"text":"2043–2046"},{"text":"Financial Controller / Costing Head / Finance Leader"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Accounting foundations"},{"text":"Financial accounting, Excel, business maths"},{"text":"Costing workbook"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Cost classification, costing methods, budgets"},{"text":"Cost-sheet project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Management accounting"},{"text":"Variance, standard costing, MIS"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced costing + analytics"},{"text":"Power BI, SQL, financial modelling"},{"text":"Cost-management capstone"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build Accounting Foundations"},{"