:"ACCA"},{"text":"CFA"},{"text":"CIA"},{"text":"MBA Finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The qualification should match the intended role rather than simply adding certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost Accountant Assistant"},{"text":"Costing Executive"},{"text":"Cost Analyst"},{"text":"Finance Executive"},{"text":"Management Accounting Associate"},{"text":"Accounts Executive"},{"text":"MIS Executive"},{"text":"FP&A Analyst"},{"text":"Cost Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Pricing Analyst"},{"text":"Finance Operations Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer interview questions"},{"type":"h","text":"Cost accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is cost accounting?"},{"text":"What is the difference between financial and cost accounting?"},{"text":"What is prime cost?"},{"text":"What is factory cost?"},{"text":"What is a cost sheet?"},{"text":"Explain fixed and variable costs."},{"text":"What is marginal costing?"},{"text":"What is standard costing?"},{"text":"What is activity-based costing?"},{"text":"What is contribution?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analysis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How do you calculate break-even point?"},{"text":"What causes a material-cost variance?"},{"text":"What is labour efficiency variance?"},{"text":"Why might actual cost exceed standard cost?"},{"text":"How would you identify an unprofitable product?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How can management reduce manufacturing costs?"},{"text":"How would you analyse budget vs actual?"},{"text":"What KPIs would you give a plant manager?"},{"text":"How can inventory affect profitability?"},{"text":"How would you investigate a sudden increase in production cost?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"p","text":